| Tertis wants exactly 160K of screen and 512K of application memory, which its
| own launcher would set up. Every other mode change leaves the screen in place.
Set Tertis$Dir <Obey$Dir>.
IconSprites <Tertis$Dir>!Sprites
WimpSlot -min 32K -max 32K
BASIC -quit <Tertis$Dir>Screen
WimpSlot -min 512K -max 512K
/<Tertis$Dir>!RunImage
